{"trace_id": "e385bc3b495c433f", "events": [{"event_type": "agent.input", "trace_id": "e385bc3b495c433f", "span_id": "14b9b2083975447a", "parent_span_id": null, "span_name": "clinical-triage-agent", "sequence_id": 1, "timestamp_ns": 1783408793713181000, "payload": {"name": "clinical-triage-agent", "input": {"id": "case-001", "presentation": "45-year-old male, chest pain radiating to left arm, diaphoresis, BP 160/95", "differential": ["Acute MI", "Unstable angina", "Aortic dissection"], "triage_level": "ESI-1", "medications": ["Aspirin 325mg", "Nitroglycerin SL", "Heparin drip"], "active_meds": ["Metformin 1000mg", "Lisinopril 20mg"]}}}, {"event_type": "model.invoke", "trace_id": "e385bc3b495c433f", "span_id": "b572867728654e4f", "parent_span_id": "14b9b2083975447a", "span_name": null, "sequence_id": 2, "timestamp_ns": 1783408797474596000, "payload": {"name": "anthropic.messages.create", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "latency_ms": 3284.4059467315674, "parameters": {"max_tokens": 400, "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "has_system": true, "system_length": 258, "messages_count": 1, "message_roles": {"user": 1}}, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "45-year-old male, chest pain radiating to left arm, diaphoresis, BP 160/95"}], "output_message": {"type": "text", "text": "## Clinical Assessment\n\n**Differential Diagnosis:**\n1. **Acute coronary syndrome (ACS)** \u2013 MOST LIKELY given classic presentation\n2. Aortic dissection\n3. Pulmonary embolism\n4. Acute hypertensive emergency\n\n**Triage Level: EMERGENT (Level 1)**\n\nThis is a potential cardiac emergency requiring immediate evaluation.\n\n**Immediate Actions:**\n- **STAT 12-lead ECG** (within 10 minutes)\n- Activate chest pain protocol\n- IV access, continuous cardiac monitoring\n- Troponin, basic labs\n- Aspirin 325 mg (if no contraindications)\n- Consider nitroglycerin if SBP permits\n\n**Drug Interaction Cautions:**\n- **Avoid nitrates** if recent phosphodiesterase-5 inhibitor use\n- If thrombolytics planned: screen for contraindications\n- **ACE inhibitors/ARBs** may be appropriate but verify baseline renal function first\n\n**Do NOT delay evaluation for further assessment.** Proceed to ED immediately."}, "otel_gen_ai": {"gen_ai.system": "anthropic", "gen_ai.operation.name": "chat", "gen_ai.request.max_tokens": 400, "gen_ai.request.model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "gen_ai.response.model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "gen_ai.response.id": "msg_011CcnHs2dNPxaAW7M4D6hx5", "gen_ai.response.finish_reasons": ["end_turn"], "gen_ai.usage.input_tokens": 92, "gen_ai.usage.output_tokens": 251, "gen_ai.usage.cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "gen_ai.usage.cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "gen_ai.anthropic.cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "gen_ai.anthropic.cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "framework": "anthropic", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 92, "completion_tokens": 251, "input_tokens": 92, "output_tokens": 251, "cached_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "response_model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "response_id": "msg_011CcnHs2dNPxaAW7M4D6hx5", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "role": "assistant", "content_block_counts": {"text": 1}, "has_thinking": false, "prompt_tokens": 92, "completion_tokens": 251, "total_tokens": 343}}, {"event_type": "cost.record", "trace_id": "e385bc3b495c433f", "span_id": "b572867728654e4f", "parent_span_id": "14b9b2083975447a", "span_name": null, "sequence_id": 3, "timestamp_ns": 1783408797474789000, "payload": {"provider": "anthropic", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "cost_usd": 0.0010776, "prompt_tokens": 92, "completion_tokens": 251, "input_tokens": 92, "output_tokens": 251, "cached_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "framework": "anthropic"}}, {"event_type": "agent.output", "trace_id": "e385bc3b495c433f", "span_id": "14b9b2083975447a", "parent_span_id": null, "span_name": "clinical-triage-agent", "sequence_id": 4, "timestamp_ns": 1783408797475154000, "payloa