{"trace_id": "ff7d6b343b5f4661", "events": [{"event_type": "agent.input", "trace_id": "ff7d6b343b5f4661", "span_id": "d4aab952bcc44021", "parent_span_id": null, "span_name": "clinical-triage-agent", "sequence_id": 1, "timestamp_ns": 1783408797475526000, "payload": {"name": "clinical-triage-agent", "input": {"id": "case-002", "presentation": "28-year-old female, severe headache, photophobia, neck stiffness, fever 102F", "differential": ["Bacterial meningitis", "Viral meningitis", "Subarachnoid hemorrhage"], "triage_level": "ESI-2", "medications": ["Ceftriaxone 2g IV", "Vancomycin 1g IV", "Dexamethasone 0.15mg/kg"], "active_meds": []}}}, {"event_type": "model.invoke", "trace_id": "ff7d6b343b5f4661", "span_id": "c2bcbeb97c01493c", "parent_span_id": "d4aab952bcc44021", "span_name": null, "sequence_id": 2, "timestamp_ns": 1783408800271229000, "payload": {"name": "anthropic.messages.create", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "latency_ms": 2795.088291168213, "parameters": {"max_tokens": 400, "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "has_system": true, "system_length": 258, "messages_count": 1, "message_roles": {"user": 1}}, "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "28-year-old female, severe headache, photophobia, neck stiffness, fever 102F"}], "output_message": {"type": "text", "text": "## Clinical Assessment\n\n**Differential Diagnosis:**\n1. **Bacterial meningitis** (most concerning)\n2. Viral meningitis\n3. Viral encephalitis\n4. Migraine with fever (less likely given triad)\n5. Subarachnoid hemorrhage\n\n**Triage Level: EMERGENT (Red)**\n\nThis classic triad of fever, headache, and neck stiffness suggests meningitis until proven otherwise.\n\n**Immediate Actions:**\n- Blood cultures before antibiotics\n- CT head (if papilledema/focal neuro signs)\n- Lumbar puncture with CSF analysis\n- Empiric antibiotics without delay (ceftriaxone + vancomycin \u00b1 ampicillin)\n\n**Drug Interaction Cautions:**\n- If contraindicated medications in history, note interactions with cephalosporins, fluoroquinolones, or ampicillin\n- Verify allergy history before antibiotic selection\n\n**Critical:** Do not delay antibiotics waiting for imaging if meningitis suspected."}, "otel_gen_ai": {"gen_ai.system": "anthropic", "gen_ai.operation.name": "chat", "gen_ai.request.max_tokens": 400, "gen_ai.request.model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "gen_ai.response.model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "gen_ai.response.id": "msg_011CcnHsGQLtorjdmFkquzLc", "gen_ai.response.finish_reasons": ["end_turn"], "gen_ai.usage.input_tokens": 91, "gen_ai.usage.output_tokens": 242, "gen_ai.usage.cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "gen_ai.usage.cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "gen_ai.anthropic.cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "gen_ai.anthropic.cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "framework": "anthropic", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 91, "completion_tokens": 242, "input_tokens": 91, "output_tokens": 242, "cached_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "response_model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "response_id": "msg_011CcnHsGQLtorjdmFkquzLc", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "role": "assistant", "content_block_counts": {"text": 1}, "has_thinking": false, "prompt_tokens": 91, "completion_tokens": 242, "total_tokens": 333}}, {"event_type": "cost.record", "trace_id": "ff7d6b343b5f4661", "span_id": "c2bcbeb97c01493c", "parent_span_id": "d4aab952bcc44021", "span_name": null, "sequence_id": 3, "timestamp_ns": 1783408800271569000, "payload": {"provider": "anthropic", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "cost_usd": 0.0010408, "prompt_tokens": 91, "completion_tokens": 242, "input_tokens": 91, "output_tokens": 242, "cached_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "framework": "anthropic"}}, {"event_type": "agent.output", "trace_id": "ff7d6b343b5f4661", "span_id": "d4aab952bcc44021", "parent_span_id": null, "span_name": "clinical-triage-agent", "sequence_id": 4, "timestamp_ns": 1783408800272346000, "payload": {"name": "clinical-tria